    {
      "id": "4B527E9BB472CF89",
      "title": "Low level fuel rod packaging",
      "subtitle": "Complete the formal project after non-destructive sampling inspection",
      "description": "[
        \"Send the filled ordinary fuel rods for sealing inspection. The original fuel rods under inspection will be returned; after the experimental records are complete, the low-level fuel rod packaging project will be completed at the research institute.\",
        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 50 research points or MAX circuit × 2, steel plate × 24 to pay the base fee; an additional 1,200 ticks and 2,013,265,920 EU/t are required. Advanced ones are corrected according to the current material pressure.\",
