      "id": "4B50645A14FB0B24",
      "title": "small reactor engineering",
      "subtitle": "Do the cold interlock test first",
      "description": "[
        \"Take the rod shell, fuel rod and stabilizer to check the cold interlock of the small reactor. The original quantities of the three types of physical objects will be returned, and then the formal research will be completed and the controller manufacturing conditions will be obtained.\",
