      "title": "Coolant heat exchange return",
      "subtitle": "Check the hot loop with real load records",
      "description": "[
        \"Let the small reactor actually complete the power generation batch, and then send the thermal coolant and packaging components for inspection. The research will also check the load facts and samples. After completion, the heat exchange reflow and pressure-bearing main material processes will be connected.\",
        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 90 research points or MAX circuit × 2, steel plate × 32 to pay the base fee; an additional 1,800 ticks and 8,053,063,680 EU/t are required. Advanced ones are corrected according to the current material pressure.\",
        \"The institute withholds power based on the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the stable medium regeneration tower reactor thermal cycle and heat exchange working conditions will be unlocked; the original medium regeneration route will be retained.\"
      ]",
