        \"Input HRV mechanical cubes, 32 ultra-dense pressure-bearing soul steel plates, 4 ultra-density pressure-bearing soul steel frame components, 32 ultra-dense pressure-bearing soul steel rings and other materials listed by JEI into the assembly machine, and use HRV power supply to make the first batch of HDV mechanical cubes.\"
